WEBVTT

00:00:00.103 --> 00:00:05.132
This slide focuses on if / else chooses between two
paths The goal is to

00:00:05.158 --> 00:00:11.825
understand the idea in plain language before
connecting it to code or analytical use Two-way

00:00:11.851 --> 00:00:17.130
decision Use if and else when exactly one of two
outcomes should happen Choose between

00:00:17.143 --> 00:00:22.735
two outcomes Before running the example predict what
the output

00:00:22.761 --> 00:00:28.067
should look like Run it in the browser inspect the
result then change one value

00:00:28.198 --> 00:00:35.542
condition or input and run it again Pay attention to
what changed and why Change

00:00:35.569 --> 00:00:40.782
sales and rerun to see a different branch Control
Flow & Decision Making
